2024-03-27T19:57:44 | it is safe to assume that mandoc just works with UTF-8 on both the input and
2024-03-27T19:57:44 | output sides - in literally each and every operating system providing a
2024-03-27T19:57:44 | mandoc port or package, even those that are seriously lagging behind. This
2024-03-27T19:57:44 | patch will also be pushed upstream. OK tb@
